iler":false,"text":"A masked man who works as a special representative for the Piskis Republic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He allows the protagonist's group who are fleeing from the Veke Kingdom into his country and helps them make arrangements for living."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He never lets people see his face, but his skill in politics is very good and the citizens greatly trust him."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is actually King Balthazar of Fasan, who faked his death and went into hiding."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48749"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec2bab80d86efa2605e4180d3d2860a97c462a07320a8e77c03b25bb9c02b64e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/6275a37a02bab8f9071a275747940a62e56733190e0e7c8a2c199dd7b695fdc9.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤原 啓治","creatorId":"vndb:s384","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s384","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s384","name":"藤原 啓治","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68138","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c48752","characterName":"イグナツィ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c48752"},"originalCharacterName":"イグナツィ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Not just your face, but your heart is beautiful too. I didn't think I could meet a girl like you in this town.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An instructor that swore loyalty to the prince of the Alus Kingdom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's wandering from place to place searching for the prince who has gone missing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A playboy who loves beautiful women and 